71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tb26x0m36C8Q7kNvwGYLRjQ&_nc_oc=Adra3j5SPEF0jNmxelx188FH-4RD1qCNCJn2kyo4ERLcVQs-c203FjBfmAeqwW5mQyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCdxaszBMqw8YftAySu9EJz-KDH6Pt5nv_4Ny98RAMJCA&oe=6A5240B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xbg41SJs7a4Q7kNvwHYCJzn&_nc_oc=Ado7Dr3r9RdQTAVkEslVvxu4A4-OnWsP51Bj5zYHHmsA-qiDt7D1VVUw7-qnGwltYso&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB3M1b6QfWAsHLttNkzbCP5jfhRKVI1ysrH4ociJZLh9w&oe=6A525393"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qxS3csETIhAQ7kNvwG67Pxo&_nc_oc=AdpzuzWwOc5v4pI9A35H6t7138g3L18IGC5ip7QQGnHVKzDPlBNsBuNXUtqqQW1rtBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB7rcgavnKz21WEy9CYf5zzOH3-VPiM4UeFLBGSEA0jpA&oe=6A5251DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: